WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.967
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:02.969
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:03.969
We hope you're doing well
and, now,

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:05.071
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.406
According to the latest
poll numbers,

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:09.442
President Biden's
approval rating is 38%,

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.844
which is the lowest it's been
since taking office.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:14.947
Well, come on, America,
what do you want him to do,

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:16.982
something?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:18.517
According
to a new Senate report,

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:21.454
former President Trump directly
asked the Justice Department,

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:25.992
on nine separate occasions,
to overturn the 2020 election.

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:27.193
Nine?!

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.128
Was he in the backseat
of the car?

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:30.329
[ As Trump ]
Will you overturn the election?

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:31.865
"No!"
Will you overturn the election?

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.065
"No!"
Will you overturn the --

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:34.767
[ Laughter ]
In her new book,

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.236
former White House Press
Secretary Stephanie Grisham

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.505
writes that Ivanka Trump used
to ask her

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:42.408
to suppress unflattering
news stories about her.

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:43.943
Here's what that
would look like.

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:48.515
[ Clacking ]

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:49.882
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.918
According to a new report,
former President Trump

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:53.652
did not want to use anesthesia

00:00:53.652 --> 00:00:57.824
for his secret 2019 colonoscopy
because he did not want

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.959
Mike Pence
to temporarily assume power,

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:02.428
but joke's on him
because Mike Pence

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:03.796
is anesthesia.

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:05.732
[ As Pence ]
Mr. President, I just want

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.267
to sincerely thank you
for your leadership.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.804
Okay, he's out.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:13.673
Today was Russian President
Vladimir Putin's 69th birthday

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.876
and I think I know
what he wished for.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.978
Universal Studios in Orlando
has announced

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:21.514
that the "Shrek 4-D"
simulator show

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.883
will close next year
because, it turns out,

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.686
nobody actually wanted
to smell Shrek.

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:27.954
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:30.289
Netflix announced yesterday
that it will release

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:32.725
11 new holiday movies
before Christmas

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:35.361
and I think they're
running low on ideas.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.663
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,
in a new interview,

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:40.132
singer Meghan Trainor said
she and her husband have

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:42.334
two toilets next to each other
in their bathroom

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:43.736
so they can spend
more time together,

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:46.105
in case you're wondering
why there was no

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:48.608
"Stars -- They're Just Like Us!"
section this week.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.209
[ Laughter ]
And that, you guys,

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:51.277
was a monologue.

